IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cbw-rules`

-- Crimes (Biological Weapons) Act 1976 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`toxins` MEANS `biological agents or toxins of types and quantities with no prophylactic, protective or other peaceful justification`
`weapons` MEANS `weapons, equipment or means of delivery designed to use them for hostile purposes or armed conflict`
`peaceful` MEANS `agents or toxins justified for peaceful purposes`
`retain` MEANS `develop, produce, stockpile, acquire or retain it`

GIVEN k IS A `Kind of person`, cit IS A BOOLEAN, w IS A `Where`, h IS A `What I hold`
GIVETH A `Weapons case`
`a case of` k `citizen` cit `acting` w `holding` h MEANS
    `Weapons case` OF k, cit, w, h, `retain`, JUST (Date 1 3 2026), FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 20 4 2026

`home` MEANS `in Australia or an external Territory`

#ASSERT `I commit an offence` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`)
#ASSERT `I commit an offence` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `weapons`)
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit an offence` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `peaceful`))
-- s 5
#ASSERT `I commit an offence` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` TRUE `acting` `outside Australia` `holding` `toxins`)
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit an offence` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `outside Australia` `holding` `toxins`))
-- s 8(1): doing none of the acts
#ASSERT NOT (`I commit an offence` (`Weapons case` OF `a natural person`, FALSE, `home`, `toxins`, `none of these`, NOTHING, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 20 4 2026))
-- s 8(2)
#ASSERT `the maximum units for` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`) EQUALS 100
#ASSERT `the maximum units for` (`a case of` `a corporation` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`) EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT (`the weapons position for` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`))'s `I may be imprisoned for life`
#ASSERT NOT ((`the weapons position for` (`a case of` `a corporation` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`))'s `I may be imprisoned for life`)
-- s 9: seized 1 March 2026, held to 30 April 2026.
#ASSERT `it is forfeited` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`)
#ASSERT `the last day of retention for` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`) EQUALS JUST (Date 30 4 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day of retention for` (`Weapons case` OF `a natural person`, FALSE, `home`, `toxins`, `retain`, JUST (Date 1 3 2026), TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 20 4 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 10
#ASSERT NOT (`I may be committed for trial` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`))
#ASSERT `I may be committed for trial` (`Weapons case` OF `a natural person`, FALSE, `home`, `toxins`, `retain`, NOTHING, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, Date 20 4 2026)
-- s 12
#ASSERT `the last day to give notice for` (`a case of` `a natural person` `citizen` FALSE `acting` `home` `holding` `toxins`) EQUALS Date 15 4 2026
#ASSERT NOT (`the certificate is admissible` (`Weapons case` OF `a natural person`, FALSE, `home`, `toxins`, `retain`, NOTHING, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, Date 20 4 2026))
